# Environment limits

`bundle` commands that need this app's gems fail in this environment. Paste the command and leave the run to the user.

Stay inside this repo. Do not search other apps or the home directory for gem source or data.

Installing modules and database operations can also hit permission errors. That is intentional. Do not work around them. Give the user the command to run.
